## Rust
# Build output for any Cargo project in rust_core/.
target/

# rustc/rustfmt temporary files.
**/*.rs.bk

# Keep Cargo.lock files committed for reproducible application builds.

## Angular / Node.js
# Installed dependencies and Angular CLI cache.
node_modules/
.angular/cache/

# Angular and TypeScript build output.
dist/
out-tsc/

# Test and coverage output.
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Package-manager logs and debug output.
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

## Environment and local configuration
# Keep example files such as .env.example tracked; ignore local secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

## Editors and operating systems
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.iml

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
